{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22005","headline":"赠友五首 一 · 白居易","name":"赠友五首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一年十二月，每月有常令。\n君出臣奉行，谓之握金镜。\n由兹六气顺，以遂万物性。\n时令一反常，生灵受其病。\n周汉德下衰，王风始不竞。\n又从斩鼂错，诸侯益强盛。\n百里不同禁，四时自爲政。\n盛夏兴土功，方春剿人命。\n谁能救其失，待君佐邦柄。\n峨峨象魏门，悬法彝伦正。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22005.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22005","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}